theme_override_styles/panel = SubResource("StyleBoxTexture_io5eh")
script = ExtResource("4_we3yf")
era_name = "Reiwa"
start_year = 2019
end_year = 2026
tooltip = "The current era, beginning with a historic imperial abdication and influenced by the COVID pandemic.

With a shrinking workforce and a rapidly aging population, traditional corporate norms continue to disintegrate, with [i]nomikai[/i] (mandatory after-hours parties) losing favor, and an emphasis on work-life balance and remote work growing. Analog business practices, such as fax machines and [i]hanko[/i] (personal ink stamps), are also finally being digitized.

Until recently, diversity and internationally integration had been increasing, with record numbers of foreigners joining the workforce, though recent political shifts have pushed against this trend.

Despite ongoing economic and political anxieties, Japan remains culturally influential. For example, this game was made by someone with no roots in Japan."

